## rubber-motor

rubber-motor-ask = Twice the turns of the band — how many times further does the car go?
rubber-motor-title = A car on a rubber-band motor
rubber-motor-question = We make a car with a rubber-band motor: the band is hooked to the front axle and winds round the back one. We wind it 3 turns, let go and measure how far it goes. Then 6 turns — twice as many. How many times further will the car go?
rubber-motor-choices = Twice: twice the turns, twice as far
rubber-motor-choices-2 = Four times
rubber-motor-choices-3 = The same: it is the same band
rubber-motor-setup = A cardboard car: two axles (the back one a pencil), bottle-cap wheels, an office rubber band; the home-made dynamometer, a tape measure, a long corridor
